  "system": {
    "identifier": "lyonesse-knight-of-the-sacred-word-voice-of-authority",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><b>Knight of the Sacred Word · уровень 3</b></p><p>Your voice carries force that can command the body as surely as your strikes.<br>Once per turn, when you hit a creature with a Monk weapon or an Unarmed Strike, you can expend 1 Focus<br>Point to issue a single-word command as part of the attack. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or suffer one of the following effects of your choice until the start of your next turn:<br>Halt. The creature’s Speed becomes 0.<br>Silence. The creature cannot speak or cast spells with<br>Verbal components.<br>Yield. The creature has Disadvantage on attack rolls.</p><hr><p><b>Автоматизация / ограничения:</b></p><ul><li>После попадания не чаще 1/ход; снять в начале следующего хода. На 6 уровне Striking Word бросается отдельной кнопкой.</li></ul>"
    },
